th='Wit and humour can solve delicate problems and heal relationships; a good ruler admits his mistakes.',
sum='The Vijayanagara Empire was famous for its glory, wealth and culture. King Krishnadeva Raya (1509–29 CE) was a great warrior, a poet (Amuktamalyada, Jambavati Parinayam) and a patron of learning; his court had eight great poets, the Ashtadiggajas, including Allasani Peddana and Tenali Ramakrishna, famous for his quick wit. Once the king quarrelled with Queen Thirumalambal over a trivial matter and stopped speaking to her and visiting her; the palace became quiet and forlorn. The queen told Tenali Rama what had happened: the king had written a poem full of vague expressions; his ministers avoided him, and when he recited it to her late in the evening she was so tired that she yawned several times. The king thought she was disrespecting his poem and stormed off. Rama promised to help. Next morning, in a court discussion about improving paddy cultivation, Rama brought a plate of “revolutionary” paddy seeds that would give three times the yield. The courtiers mocked him. The king called the idea absurd. Rama said the real problem was not the seeds but the person who sows them – what if he had a habit of yawning while sowing? The court laughed; even the king yawned. Rama said, “Is there anyone in this world who does not yawn? It is as natural as breathing.” The king realised he had been unfair to the queen, apologised to her that evening, and she happily agreed to listen to his poem. The royal couple rewarded Rama, and the palace was full of joy again.',
te='విజయనగర రాజు శ్రీకృష్ణదేవరాయలు రాణి తిరుమలాంబతో చిన్న విషయానికి గొడవపడి మాట్లాడటం మానేశాడు. ఆయన రాసిన కవితను వింటూ అలసిన రాణి ఆవలించిందని రాజుకు కోపం. రాణి తెనాలి రామకృష్ణుని సాయం అడిగింది. సభలో వరి సాగు చర్చలో రాముడు “మూడు రెట్లు దిగుబడి ఇచ్చే విత్తనాలు” తెచ్చి, “విత్తేవాడు ఆవలిస్తూ విత్తితే ఎలా?” అన్నాడు. అందరూ నవ్వారు, రాజు కూడా ఆవలించాడు. “ఆవలించని వారు ఎవరైనా ఉన్నారా? అది శ్వాస తీసుకున్నంత సహజం” అని రాముడు చెప్పగా రాజు తన తప్పు తెలుసుకుని రాణికి క్షమాపణ చెప్పాడు. రాముడికి బహుమతులు ఇచ్చారు.',
